    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: 22 July 2026</em></p>

    <h2>1. Who controls your information</h2>
    <p>
      The data controller is Iris Harbor Sp z oo, which operates Waylen from
      Marszałka Józefa Piłsudskiego ul. 63 lok. 9, 41-902 Bytom, Poland. For
      privacy questions or requests, use our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>
      or call +48 733 855 863.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
    <p>Depending on how you use the website, we may collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>your first name, email address and consent choice when you join a mailing list or waitlist;</li>
      <li>your name, email address and message when you send a question through our contact form;</li>
      <li>booking details you provide when scheduling a consultation, such as your name, contact details, chosen time and meeting information;</li>
      <li>information you choose to provide during a consultation or when receiving a Waylen service; and</li>
      <li>limited technical and security information, such as IP address, browser details and request logs, processed by our hosting and anti-abuse services.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Why we use it</h2>
    <table class="table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Purpose</th><th>Legal basis</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Answer questions, arrange consultations and take steps you request before receiving a service</td>
          <td>Steps before a contract or our legitimate interest in responding to you</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Send account and service updates you have opted into</td>
          <td>Your consent, confirmed through double opt-in</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Deliver agreed guidance services and maintain service records</td>
          <td>Performance of a contract and legal obligations</td>
